  "body": "Elevated Living, Exceptional Space & A View To Match\r\n\r\nHeld tightly for 20 years, this much-loved family home is now ready for its next chapter. Our vendors have moved on, their intentions are clear, and this property will be sold.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture sweeping sea and urban outlooks, this substantial home delivers an exceptional combination of scale, versatility and lifestyle across two impressive levels. From the moment you arrive, there's a sense that this home offers something more - more space, more flexibility and more opportunity for the entire family.\r\n\r\nGenerous proportions, multiple living spaces and two fully functioning kitchens create genuine versatility, with excellent separation between the upper and lower levels. Growing families can spread out, teenagers can enjoy greater independence, extended family can have their own space, and regular guests can be accommodated with ease.\r\n\r\nThe home really comes into its own when it's time to entertain. Upstairs, the expansive deck takes full advantage of the elevated outlook - an incredible setting for long summer evenings, drinks with friends or simply sitting back and enjoying the changing view. Downstairs, living flows naturally to a private courtyard, creating another relaxed outdoor space to enjoy.\r\n\r\nAnd there's more to the lifestyle outside. There is room for the family boat, while concept plans have previously been drafted to incorporate an inground swimming pool, offering inspiration for those wanting to take the outdoor setting to another level.\r\n\r\nRecent improvements complement the home beautifully, including newly renovated bathrooms, new kwila decking welcoming you at the entrance, new garage carpet and updated carpet to selected bedrooms. A double internal-access garage adds everyday convenience, while the sheer scale of the home provides space that can continue to evolve alongside your family.\r\n\r\nAfter 20 years in the same hands, opportunities like this don't come along often. With our vendors having moved on, the next move belongs to you.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n* Elevated sea and urban views\r\n* Held by the same owners for 20 years\r\n* Vendors have moved on - property will be sold\r\n* Expansive upper-level entertaining deck capturing the outlook\r\n* Two fully functioning kitchens across two levels\r\n* Multiple generous living and entertaining spaces\r\n* Excellent separation between upper and lower levels\r\n* Ideal flexibility for families, teenagers, guests or extended family\r\n* Lower-level living flowing to a private courtyard\r\n* Room to accommodate the family boat\r\n* Concept plans previously drafted for an inground swimming pool\r\n* Newly renovated bathrooms\r\n* New Kwila decking at the front entrance\r\n* Spacious Double internal-access garage\r\n* New garage carpet\r\n* Updated carpet to selected bedrooms\r\n* Generous proportions throughout\r\n* Exceptional flexibility to adapt as your family's needs \r\n\r\nThe vendors have moved on and are ready to see this home pass into new hands. Contact Simon Davies or Renee Davies to arrange your private viewing.",
